OL,4,CCan AI spot breast cancer earlier? NHS 
OL,5,Claunches world's largest trial to find 
OL,6,Cout                                    
OL,7,GNearly 700,000 women across the UK are 
OL,8,Gto be invited to join the world's      
OL,9,Glargest trial of how artificial        
OL,10,Gintelligence can help in breast cancer 
OL,11,Gscreening.                             
OL,13,FAI will be used to review mammograms   
OL,14,Fto see if it can improve early cancer  
OL,15,Fdetection and ease the workload of     
OL,16,Fclinical staff, while not over-        
OL,17,Fdiagnosing women unnecessarily.        
OL,19,FRecruitment to the EDITH trial has     
OL,20,Falready begun at Cambridge University  
OL,21,FHospitals, the first of 30 sites       
OL,22,Facross the UK.                         
